        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Stabilize Handheld\n\nSmooths out handheld camera shake in a clip. It runs locally through ffmpeg with no API key or per-run cost.\n\n**How it works:** \"Clip\" takes your video. \"Stabilize\" smooths the motion with a smoothing value of 10, and crop_black trims the empty edges that moving the frame exposes. \"Result\" returns the steadied clip.\n\n**Try this:** Raise smoothing on \"Stabilize\" to 30 for a locked-off look, and expect a tighter crop as a result."
        },
